      "name": "Sticky Note b27f5800",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        288
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WhatsApp Hub\nEvery WhatsApp message and status for the Meta app lands here.\n\n1. Split the webhook into one item per message / status.\n2. Messages are logged once in `wa_messages` (Meta can deliver twice), then routed:\n   - a café owner's Confirm / Decline tap → the café's Apps Script, and its answer back to the owner;\n   - anything from a Content Engine client's owner → Owner Replies;\n   - everything else stays in the log for the inbox.\n3. Statuses update the sent message's row, or add one for messages other systems sent.\n\nSettings: `hub_settings` table. Errors are written on the row.",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 608,
        "height": 224
      }
    },
